  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="f-68" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Union employees received a 4.0% general wage increase effective 04/13/2025. Hourly Non-Union employees received a 3.0% adjustment on 03/30/2025. Exempt, Salaried Employees received a 3.23% adjustment on 03/30/2025. Officers &amp;amp; Executives received a 4.28% adjustment on 03/30/2025. CEO received a 20% adjustment effective 3/31/2025.&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
